## Phase 5 — Advanced Patterns (Days 8–10)

### 5.1 Pre-commit Hooks (Run tools locally before push)
```bash
pip install pre-commit
```
`.pre-commit-config.yaml`:
```yaml
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/psf/black
    rev: 24.4.2
    hooks: [{ id: black }]
  - repo: https://github.com/PyCQA/isort
    rev: 5.13.2
    hooks: [{ id: isort }]
  - repo: https://github.com/PyCQA/flake8
    rev: 7.1.0
    hooks: [{ id: flake8 }]
  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/mirrors-mypy
    rev: v1.10.0
    hooks: [{ id: mypy }]
  - repo: https://github.com/PyCQA/bandit
    rev: 1.7.9
    hooks: [{ id: bandit, args: ["-r", "src/", "-ll"] }]
```
```bash
pre-commit install    # installs git hook
pre-commit run --all-files   # test it manually
```

### 5.2 Branch Protection Rules on GitHub
1. **Settings → Branches → Add rule** for `main`
2. Enable: ✅ Require status checks to pass before merging
3. Select: `Code Quality Gates` from the dropdown
4. Enable: ✅ Require branches to be up to date

This means: **no broken code can merge to main.**

### 5.3 Status Badges in README
```markdown
![CI](https://github.com/<USER>/cicd-quality-demo/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)
```

### 5.4 Matrix Testing (Multiple Python versions)
```yaml
strategy:
  matrix:
    python-version: ["3.10", "3.11", "3.12"]
steps:
  - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
    with:
      python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}
```

